1812
01:26:53.700 --> 01:26:56.580
okay, now I'm gonna starve if I keep using fat

1813
01:26:56.580 --> 01:26:57.750
at this level.

1814
01:26:57.750 --> 01:26:59.760
So I'm gonna slow down my metabolism

1815
01:26:59.760 --> 01:27:02.700
