1816
01:27:02.700 --> 01:27:05.940
And that's why you need to have the science to get you.

1817
01:27:05.940 --> 01:27:08.430
Yeah, do the fasting mimicking diet, but don't go too long.

1818
01:27:08.430 --> 01:27:10.020
Don't go too short 'cause you don't enter

1819
01:27:10.020 --> 01:27:11.340
this catabolic mode.

1820
01:27:11.340 --> 01:27:13.740
Don't go too long because now you're gonna enter

1821
01:27:13.740 --> 01:27:14.643
the thrifty mode.

1822
01:27:15.660 --> 01:27:17.250
You have to thread the needle.

1823
01:27:17.250 --> 01:27:20.610
You have to convert the switch

1824
01:27:20.610 --> 01:27:25.610
and then allow it to be in the high metabolic

1825
01:27:26.760 --> 01:27:28.023
fat burning mode.

1826
01:27:28.860 --> 01:27:33.000
And for example, that carbohydrate

1827
