1831
01:27:44.430 --> 01:27:45.660
zero carbohydrate.

1832
01:27:45.660 --> 01:27:48.900
This could be one of the triggers of thrifty mode.

1833
01:27:48.900 --> 01:27:53.900
Okay, so now I am going into a very low metabolic mode

1834
01:27:55.560 --> 01:27:58.143
